msgid "Controller ROS 2 parameters"
msgstr "控制器 ROS 2 参数"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:3
#: 2552d5b7cf7043bd81ff46b5b1907f27
msgid ""
"ROS 2 parameters for public controllers in "
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control). "
"Code pin: [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48). "
"**Startup / Runtime** wording matches the READMEs in [pull request "
"#120](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/pull/120) "
"(`e1b7a147`). How to load and inspect: [Configure ROS 2 controller "
"parameters](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md). Topics "
"and FSM integers: the per-controller pages (not repeated here)."
msgstr ""
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) "
"公开控制器的 ROS 2 参数。代码钉在 [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48)。**仅启动"
" / 运行时** 措辞与 [pull request #120](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/pull/120)（`e1b7a147`）的 README 一致。如何加载与查看：[配置 ROS 2 "
"控制器参数](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md)。话题与 FSM "
"整数见各控制器页面（此处不重复）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 5a532501864f404fa4e24fe48433ce33
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "权威来源"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:8
#: c9f7bfb671b54feb8874a021b5ed1553
msgid ""
"Names, types, and defaults come from the linked README (or `auto_declare`"
" / `declare_parameter` at the code pin when the README says so). **When**"
" tags are **Runtime** / **Startup only** / **Unverified** as in #120. "
"Framework commons (`joints`, `update_rate`, `command_interfaces`, "
"`state_interfaces`, optional `command_prefix`) are on the [how-"
"to](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#framework-common-"
"parameters) only."
msgstr ""
"名称、类型和默认值来自链接的 README（README 有说明时，则以该代码钉上的 `auto_declare` / "
"`declare_parameter` 为准）。**何时生效** 标记与 #120 相同：**运行时** / **仅启动** / "
"**未核实**。框架共性键（`joints`、`update_rate`、`command_interfaces`、`state_interfaces`，以及可选的"
" "
"`command_prefix`）只写在[操作指南](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md"
"#framework-common-parameters)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:11
