msgstr "依据（#120）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 8b7c124b63ef40cdbc30e4a336b2fc7d
msgid "**Runtime**"
msgstr "**运行时**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 6652917481114e7595dc1b8e659904a3
msgid ""
"`get_parameter` on the next HOME enter, MOVEJ enter / joint command, "
"waist position plan, interpolating MoveL, MOVEJ `cartesian_defaults`, or "
"HOLD enter / each HOLD `run` (`StateHold::updateParam`)"
msgstr ""
"下次进入 HOME、进入 MOVEJ / 关节命令、腰部位置规划、插值 MoveL、MOVEJ `cartesian_defaults`，或进入 "
"HOLD / 每个 HOLD `run`（`StateHold::updateParam`）时 `get_parameter`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 8cb60fb36be24e6eabd451d346def8cf
msgid "**Startup only**"
msgstr "**仅启动**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: 4b57a37b8a8a4f7589420ec7a1713232
msgid ""
"Member set in `on_init` / constructor / first waist-planner create; or "
"README “reload / restart”"
msgstr "在 `on_init` / 构造函数 / 首次创建腰部规划器时写入成员；或 README 所说的「重新加载 / 重启」"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: ebfe2055fda04e7bb7b047c8d12f8be9
msgid "**Unverified**"
msgstr "**未核实**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:5
#: b7d03b6044ce45d8893f2f196a339d50
msgid "No documented key in these tables is Unverified in #120"
msgstr "#120 中这些表里已文档化的键都不是未核实"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:21
#: 1c7eebf9c1fa4d5b97643f6572dc09ec
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`config/ocs2/*.info` is **not** the ROS 2 parameter server. `robot_name` "
"selects `{robot_name}_description`; the task file is "
"`{pkg}/config/ocs2/task.info` unless launch YAML sets `info_file_name`."
msgstr ""
"`config/ocs2/*.info` **不是** ROS 2 参数服务器。`robot_name` 选择 "
"`{robot_name}_description`；任务文件是 `{pkg}/config/ocs2/task.info`，除非 launch "
"YAML 设置了 `info_file_name`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:24
#: ef42c3a023364514bb8fb02f2b01fb6f
msgid "Shared FSM parameters"
msgstr "共用 FSM 参数"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:26
#: d7b7c857d88f41469682e68b6f8bacc9
msgid ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** and **OCS2 Arm Controller** both use "
"`libraries/arms_controller_common/` (`StateHome`, `StateHold`, "
"`StateMoveJ`). This section indexes those shared ROS 2 names. Package-"
"specific keys, and a second copy of the Hold rows, stay in the controller"
" sections below. Fuller prose: [Shared "
"mechanisms](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#shared-"
"mechanisms)."
msgstr ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** 与 **OCS2 Arm Controller** 都使用 "
"`libraries/arms_controller_common/`（`StateHome`、`StateHold`、`StateMoveJ`）。本节是这些共用 "
"ROS 2 参数名的索引。包专有键仍写在下面各控制器小节，Hold 行也会在那里再列一份。更完整的说明：[共用机制](../../2-"
"how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#shared-mechanisms)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:28
#: 46bf4c73ec43465184559c464c99cf40
msgid ""
"Separate lists on this page: [framework-common "
"parameters](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#framework-"
"common-parameters) (`joints`, `update_rate`, `command_interfaces`, "
"`state_interfaces`, optional `command_prefix`); [Adaptive Gripper "
"Controller](#adaptive-gripper-controller) (`joint` and the force keys); "
"[arms_target_manager](#arms-target-manager) (command node). [OCS2 WBC "
"Controller](#ocs2-wbc-controller) names are the private `ocs2-wbc-"
"controller` README after access. At pin [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48) the "
"public tree’s Home / Hold `auto_declare` calls are in Basic Joint and "
"OCS2 Arm, so this index stops at those two controllers. Waist keys stay "
"in each controller section (only `waist_lifting_duration` is "
"**Runtime**)."
msgstr ""
"本页上的其他清单：[框架共性参数](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md"
"#framework-common-parameters)（`joints`、`update_rate`、`command_interfaces`、"
"`state_interfaces`，以及可选的 `command_prefix`）；[Adaptive Gripper "
"Controller](#adaptive-gripper-controller)（`joint` 与力相关键）；"
"[arms_target_manager](#arms-target-manager)（命令节点）。[OCS2 WBC "
"Controller](#ocs2-wbc-controller) 的参数名在开通后见私有 `ocs2-wbc-controller` README。"
"在代码钉 [`9a1da3ba`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/9a1da3ba3747b3042866422c2269c1d49bb02f48) 上，公开仓库里 "
"Home / Hold 的 `auto_declare` 调用位于 Basic Joint 与 OCS2 Arm，因此本索引只收录这两个控制器。腰部键仍写在各控制器小节（只有 "
"`waist_lifting_duration` 是**运行时**）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:30
#: cc260c92b566486ba49dcf0c034eab5c
msgid "Home (`StateHome`)"
msgstr "Home（`StateHome`）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:32
#: a40b2e45148048d7b04857e1630a25c3
msgid ""
"Both controllers pass `auto_declare` into `StateHome::init`, which reads "
"`home_1` … `home_10` from YAML overrides and stops at the first missing "
"name. They also `auto_declare` `home_duration`, `home_interpolation_type`"
" (`\"linear\"`), `home_tanh_scale`, and `switch_command_base`. The "
"`StateHome` constructor calls `declare_parameter` for "
"`home_max_velocity`, `home_max_acceleration`, and `home_max_jerk` when "
"those names are absent (defaults `2.0` / `4.0` / `20.0`). The common "
"README lists those limits; the Basic Joint §3 YAML example omits them. "
"Same defaults and **When** tags: [shared "
"Home](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#home-statehome)."
" OCS2-only `home_pos` / `rest_pos` are rows on the [OCS2 Arm "
"Controller](#ocs2-arm-controller) table."
msgstr ""
"两个控制器都把 `auto_declare` 传给 `StateHome::init`，由它从 YAML 覆盖项读取 `home_1` … "
"`home_10`，遇到第一个缺失的名字即停止。它们还 `auto_declare` 了 `home_duration`、"
"`home_interpolation_type`（`\"linear\"`）、`home_tanh_scale` 和 "
"`switch_command_base`。节点上还没有这些名字时，`StateHome` 构造函数会为 "
"`home_max_velocity`、`home_max_acceleration`、`home_max_jerk` 调用 "
"`declare_parameter`（默认 `2.0` / `4.0` / `20.0`）。共性 README 列出了这些限幅；Basic Joint "
"§3 的 YAML 示例未列出。相同的默认值与**何时生效**：[共用 "
"Home](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#home-statehome)。仅 "
"OCS2 的 `home_pos` / `rest_pos` 写在 [OCS2 Arm Controller](#ocs2-arm-controller) 表中。"

