#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md:47
#: 1ebdb0ef039c484c8bfe1b96a685f01c
msgid ""
"Both controllers `auto_declare` these keys (default `0.1`) and use "
"`arms_controller_common::StateHold`. The same rows: [Basic Joint Hold"
"](#basic-joint-hold) and [OCS2 Arm Hold](#ocs2-arm-hold). Enter and each "
"HOLD `run`: [shared "
"Hold](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#hold-statehold)."
" MIX HOLD impedance (`default_gains`) stays on the OCS2 Arm table."
msgstr ""
"两个控制器都 `auto_declare` 这些键（默认 `0.1`），并使用 "
"`arms_controller_common::StateHold`。同一组行：[Basic Joint "
"Hold](#basic-joint-hold) 与 [OCS2 Arm Hold](#ocs2-arm-hold)。进入 HOLD 以及每个 "
"HOLD `run`：[共用 "
"Hold](../../2-how_to/4-controllers/12-ros2_parameters.md#hold-statehold)。MIX "
"下 HOLD 阻抗（`default_gains`）仍写在 OCS2 Arm 自己的表里。"

